  "evidence_base_caveat": "The cardiac-surgery evidence base here is incomplete. This pool removes the non-cardiac contamination (COP-AF and Bessissow, excluded as thoracic / lung-resection surgery), but the PubMed search is still not a registered concept query, so discovery completeness is not established. COPPS AF (PMID 22090167) is screened in and declared absent for the primary outcome because its abstract lacks poolable arm counts or an effect+CI; any remaining gap should therefore be read as concept-search incompleteness plus extraction ambiguity, not as the search never finding that trial. The pooled estimate should be read as 'contamination removed' and provisional, NOT as the stronger, more precise benefit a complete cardiac-surgery meta-analysis reports; it will change when the search is rebuilt as a concept query.",
